de-arena", "summary": "\"PlanetSide Arena is a massive-scale, match-based, sci-fi arena shooter that reintroduces players to the revolutionary PlanetSide Franchise - the record-breaking MMOFPS series that redefined all-out planetary warfare. Played solo, in teams of three, or as part of large combat groups, PlanetSide Arena features unique character classes, seasonal progression mechanics, combined arms combat, and a variety of match-based game modes.\"\n\n\"Massive Clash\nThis intense large-scale arena pits two sides battling it out for dominance. Choose your side and prepare for a full-on assault in this massive 250 vs 250 battle.\n\nBattle Royale\nPlay solos or teams in this jetpack-fueled last mercenary standing sci-fi royal rumble. Customize your loadout, drop into the Arena, loot, and survive.\"", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/planetside-arena", "videos": [{"id": 30167, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "8AW0TuDUt5I", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8AW0TuDUt5I", "title": "PlanetSide Arena: Launch Gameplay Trailer [OFFICIAL]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8AW0TuDUt5I/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 30166, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "JgcOgOcgSyg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JgcOgOcgSyg", "title": "PlanetSide Arena: Cinematic Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JgcOgOcgSyg/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 30164, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "Eoz_FWC39BY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Eoz_FWC39BY", "title": "Inside the Arena: Vehicles & Weapons", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Eoz_FWC39BY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 30165, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "LhMlgsH35Rs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LhMlgsH35Rs", "title": "Inside the Arena: Introducing PlanetSide Arena", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LhMlgsH35Rs/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 279, "name": "PlanetSide"}]}